    // a1=1 < a2 < ... < ak.
    // Build a caterpillar-like path of "centers" c1-c2-...-ck.
    // Let subtree size at cj toward the c1 side be aj.
    // We realize this by attaching (aj-aj-1-1) leaves to cj for j>=2,
